{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05CFD0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加也有很多蜂鸟。这里的人好像叫它们Colibri。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"Colibri吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":19,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"蜂鸟是世界上最小的鸟。虽然不同种类有所差异，一般大约10厘米，小的甚至只有5厘米。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"明明那么小，却完整地长成了鸟的样子，简直让人觉得不可思议。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"那么小的话，感觉会被误认成虫子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"实际上，它们好像经常被误认成天蛾。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"这些小家伙以花蜜为食，为了吸蜜，喙也长得又细又长。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"它们的振翅频率在鸟类中也是遥遥领先。小型蜂鸟甚至每秒超过70次！很厉害吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"为了什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"为了悬停在空中吸食花蜜。而且它们还能就这样向后飞。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"悬停在空中……这不就是悬停飞行吗！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"所以Amanda他们才把那架直升机叫作<R=蜂鸟,COLIBRI>啊。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=蜂鸟,COLIBRI>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"不过，把鸟的名字拿来给兵器命名，不觉得很失礼吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"我可不懂鸟的心情。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""}]}